            <ArticleTitle>Equipment and methods for simple sensory testing.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>387-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Four simple tests which can be used for routine sensory testing following trigeminal nerve injuries are suggested. The methods for constructing the equipment needed for these tests are described.</AbstractText>
